  "details": "I need a portal that I can specify instances and regions.\nIn my case, I make the Immersive Cloud's hub world that I can lead Murder Mystery players to the world each text and gimmic has. But, in now state of Portal, if we pass through portal and we are America region and ping is high. It's noncence. So we DROP PORTAL MANUALLY, IN SPITE OF I have created a gimmick that produces a portal with a cool presentation!!\nAnyway, I think if World portal has specify  instances and regions,  It is believed that this will lead to a stronger sense of connection between worlds.\nI think it would lead to a more active community if we could feel more organically that we are all in one world, what do you think!",
